From 2067875f3c7d025acfc3705bd5e0dc36ea2a3a43 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: review <review@local>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 10:03:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Specialize the allocation helper, and say where the checks
 are and what they cover

The helper's vararg now carries a length parameter, so the call inside
is static for any number of arguments. The tag file's header and the
docs name the allocation check, and the record file's comment says that
the implicit check measures the guards, since no record lists the two
implicit labels.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LA3FukgbRCMkra999BhdDw
---
 docs/src/energy_source_tags.md         | 4 ++++
 test/energy_source_tags_integration.jl | 8 ++++++--
 test/process_record_integration.jl     | 7 +++++--
 3 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

